#. Description of the plugin
#: fullworks-gravity-image-resize.php
msgid "Downscales images uploaded through Gravity Forms file-upload fields, which never pass through the WordPress media pipeline and so are missed by every media-library optimiser. Includes WP-CLI tools for the existing backlog."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: fullworks-gravity-image-resize.php
msgid "Alan Fuller"
msgstr ""

